<title>POLAND: Agros Q1 net falls to PLN 2.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Agros Q1 net falls to PLN 2.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agros preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.06 vs	4.64</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.94 vs	6.83</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.80 vs	5.31</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 27.86 vs     34.08</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  23.62 vs     26.49</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01 vs     0.01 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.13 vs     1.52</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.38 vs     7.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.49 vs     4.82</p>
<p>    investment				19.96 vs    27.54</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
